  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Music show
To engage the public with reknown artists and the themes and values of BF
Public speaking
The CSOs presents themselves and engage public in a more in-depth and multi-faceted discussion of what is beyond GDP, and inspire participants and audiences with a future co-created by multiple actors
CSO display booths
To challenge the GDP-centered development and chasing after material needson collective and individual levels, emphasizing the needs for human-centered values.
Media
To present youth and CSO actors as change agents that push Vietnam development to be more inclusive and sustainable.

CSO conference
To draw on plural voices and views to challenge existing social norms (consumerism, materialism, heteronormative values as normal etc), philanthrophy ecosystem and showcase how CSO and other sector actors can co-create a future that include and benefits all.</narrative>
  </description>
